    <namerecord nameID="10" platformID="3" platEncID="1" langID="0x409">
      Historical decorated letters, figures and punctuation from Baltimore 1832 and matching period sources in Boston 1832, Howe 1830 and Bruce 1828, plus the leafy-descender Oak Leaf R. Includes 31 additional ornamented letters, figures and punctuation from Howe 1830. Includes 42 additional decorated letters, scroll figures and negative figures from Boston 1832.
    </namerecord>
